OL,3,APeru earthquake damages buildings and
OL,4,Acauses power cuts
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least three people have been injured
OL,7,Fand buildings have been damaged after
OL,8,Fan earthquake struck Peru, local
OL,9,Fofficials have said.
OL,11,FThe earthquake, which occurred near the
OL,12,Fsmall settlement of Aniso in the
OL,13,Fsouthern Ayacucho region on Thursday,
OL,14,Fhad a magnitude of 6.7, the US
OL,15,FGeological Survey (USGS) said.
OL,17,FPeru's defence minister Rafael Belaunde
OL,18,Fsaid 22 homes and six schools were
OL,19,Fdamaged, local media report.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
