OL,3,APeru earthquake damages buildings and
OL,4,Acauses power cuts
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarthquakes are common in Peru, which
OL,7,Fsits along the meeting point of the
OL,8,FNazca and South American tectonic
OL,9,Fplates, and Thursday's was the latest
OL,10,Fstrong seismic event to hit South
OL,11,FAmerica in recent months, following
OL,12,Fdeadly quakes in Colombia and
OL,13,FVenezuela.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
